            <div xml:id="m-dfd49bcb-1ecd-4ba9-a21b-3d7a4d006705">
              <lg xml:id="m-20f4bbd3-40b3-4399-9ee3-1e073d777f10">
                <l xml:id="m-872c0469-4d98-4e90-9162-025637589a47" facs="#m-0d1c32a6-0f46-401b-8f40-60c776e6d743" label="ambiguous">168 Laudate Dominum. 5. a. — 7. a, c. ca, d. — 8. G, c.</l><l xml:id="m-e1330660-5304-4173-bcab-979614b581f8" facs="#m-dbf7cf17-fe6c-42c1-902a-d05559ca65bb" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confirmáta est super nos misericórdia éjus: “et véritas</l><l xml:id="m-ab870fe2-ba7f-4350-924c-7376be71b765" facs="#m-9760987b-8e49-4bab-a92d-212119962c3e" label="lyrics-like">Dómini mánet in aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-75cc6775-3b6e-48c6-a9a2-88b5c29369e1" facs="#m-48aa681d-dd2a-4f11-885b-8ffd5a879eaa" label="lyrics-like">3. Glória Pâtri, et Filio, * et Spirttui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-74ff5d5d-5187-44c3-a4a6-df5b8b182ac6" facs="#m-ab320f92-797e-4cfb-83f7-a6efdd519638" label="lyrics-like">4. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-a648feab-8ee0-41be-ab5b-3cbbdf5e1751" facs="#m-a2124dce-5389-4397-82c0-f32669a99160" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-313e944f-9502-4302-91ee-215165217a09" facs="#m-e06f0df0-2865-415f-a2d0-3509d347f1d7" label="ambiguous">Tone 5. a.</l><l xml:id="m-6533e3c0-1fb7-4684-83f0-79b96c2a92ed" facs="#m-1cb0460b-17b4-4233-b067-6463e24c03f3" label="text-like">Ending of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-61b48196-d12e-4403-a0de-88bba7e20305" facs="#m-6f942677-9531-4b81-9409-941c18dc484b" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent.</l><l xml:id="m-087cc8a5-9c64-4117-b526-29006eab3bbc" facs="#m-9ae3bee1-72f0-4347-b7e0-fd999fcf2e2c" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-e99dd780-d13d-48df-a0f7-7c08c0095471" facs="#m-fad915d5-3c20-4813-ab0a-655a41d0fe56" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum ómnes gén-tes :* laudá-te é-um ómnes pópu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-8572f9d0-b5c4-4ef4-a449-d7ff07ea88b2" facs="#m-7b2d78d0-43ce-47cd-a96e-aea9d81ff631" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confirmáta est super nos misericórdia éjus: * et véritas</l><l xml:id="m-1771483d-6d0a-4b5f-88f3-45671b1a730b" facs="#m-131114ad-0af9-46f4-a9d2-ce5a04d49a2d" label="lyrics-like">Dómini mánet in aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-d49213f1-255b-4281-971b-a86ff427ae3f" facs="#m-064331de-8801-43a0-84db-93c6930f436b" label="lyrics-like">3. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-99b56618-844f-40cf-a75d-345b74640a0e" facs="#m-1d404160-e0c3-46d9-8752-6ddfcf5c0a61" label="lyrics-like">4. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ae46402-e441-4e51-975b-b5a77f86d6f3" facs="#m-cff7b72f-0202-4216-a341-cdf489ae28b0" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b937e0a6-3082-4085-bc7e-fdb723bee4f2" facs="#m-3f76f13f-121d-44d6-b20f-6b7d62d0d553" label="ambiguous">Tone 7. a, e, es, d.</l><l xml:id="m-47c8a77e-77d3-4530-863c-98ca577fad35" facs="#m-f6532125-406e-4fcb-abdb-72aabde3a474" label="text-like">Mediant of z accents.</l><l xml:id="m-2712b255-7bb8-4b3a-8aab-5997ee672de2" facs="#m-d7c18697-935a-463c-860c-1bdb48cb72f3" label="text-like">Endings of a accent¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ed6f4ce-4cd9-4485-9f58-4a176b21b9f5" facs="#m-52c576b7-b6c9-4329-ab7b-5498954e1afa" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-2f847318-f0c9-49b2-b13c-d4831117f1f4" facs="#m-586ea791-d708-4f54-9bc9-5c9c33b44dd0" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum ómnes gén-tes :“laudá-te é-um ómnes pópudi.</l><l xml:id="m-22278312-4016-4564-b595-f883e808f0ef" facs="#m-bd1eafb3-f16b-4011-9472-1487164e6a09" label="ambiguous">d</l><l xml:id="m-44e5ac64-1446-4fec-9198-198c9d2801b8" facs="#m-c61f138d-1c8d-4f8e-8315-305db872c2fc" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-cb3a5935-b620-402f-9787-abf4dc2c253c" facs="#m-9d569940-fb1f-450e-9e89-aee6acd8d5a4" label="lyrics-like">or: pópu-li. o:pópu-li. or : pópu-li.</l><l xml:id="m-58f32293-eca6-4040-a614-0e653ae4407a" facs="#m-1b7bf06d-5d96-440a-91c1-48644912ad6f" label="lyrics-like">2. Quóniam confirmáta est super nos misericórdia éjus:“et véritas</l><l xml:id="m-9122d872-5e8c-4110-afe2-cbd59f52aab5" facs="#m-4dd5744c-4509-4118-a404-f907d3b2b125" label="lyrics-like">Dómini mánet in aetérnum.</l><l xml:id="m-70a42af3-f588-4e2b-828c-82fa979b6082" facs="#m-1402dce6-5b44-4caa-9997-f8f6ab76aa35" label="lyrics-like">3. Glória Pâtri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-85abc480-5635-429e-836a-b11e786c05fe" facs="#m-c04469b8-a1ae-44ea-a682-b79ab060286b" label="lyrics-like">4. Sicut érat in principio, et núne, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4759622e-e08d-4d86-a38e-db1c65cfa346" facs="#m-bb618ed1-5b9a-4ea7-8a17-dc151f0dafad" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-2b34a094-2e3e-497a-812c-11ad85ddec28" facs="#m-2eedaa0b-0c07-4e3a-90b4-0cbb4a4dceab" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. G, e.</l><l xml:id="m-39f7d1e6-33e4-4319-93be-37205fecce73" facs="#m-148d2425-39bf-4081-a71a-7963620bc1cf" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent.</l><l xml:id="m-7f044e29-d774-4f6a-b035-48de6276be19" facs="#m-b048dfb6-d0ab-4f95-9106-7326189f5a8c" label="text-like">Endings of 1 accent with a prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-cbf0f1c0-ec31-45b7-b0d0-ea5fa065768b" facs="#m-1797dce5-dc26-4579-86b7-360d236ba42b" label="ambiguous">tory syllables</l><l xml:id="m-a41ff9cb-a027-41b2-889b-f81dde6f8758" facs="#m-efe10386-aced-4b6e-a5b3-3ca17aa90344" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum ómnes gén-tes:* laudá-te é-um ómnes pópuli.</l><l xml:id="m-14498f2c-bc4d-42f5-851e-d926f5c47d9e" facs="#m-5b613102-ed7f-4cb3-976b-5bce3b782a81" label="lyrics-like">or: ómnes pópu-li.</l></lg>
